    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp local-id=\"a8011b122921\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d3c0fcdc0616\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"64054b8a5fd6\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a System user\u003c/strong\u003e I want to be able to import customers or contracts list when creating Mass E-Mail communication item. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e912ac13dbf4\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003e I will be able to reduce the time and risk of mistakes. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1ea8458c0bac\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"132af8f7ed1a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1155779d911a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"0223e8700c73\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"d6d02ba06de8\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b9e8a6c189da\"\u003eTo be able to see Import Button in Mass E-Mail communication creation page if user has one of these Permissions:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"d0e2bd52e2e7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"56024e95c74e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a18c34f26485\"\u003eCreate Mass E-mail communication\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ea81cf7f5eab\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b3490550aa99\"\u003eEdit Mass E-mail communication drafts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"db71fd6ddb19\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2c99d11d9235\"\u003eAfter clicking on Mass import icon will open import page with radio buttons with two hardcoded values:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"84fd4880e46a\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"8a2f65124762\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a94017b2b3b5\"\u003eUpload Customers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0d3ee01281d5\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fc0655cc28ac\"\u003eUpload Contracts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"47283134337a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d43a8aa2f8dd\"\u003eAfter selecting, user should have possibility to:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"065c9854f0d1\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"897e1ed57741\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3f92187b3c84\"\u003eChoose xlsx file to upload\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9ad51a1c64e0\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4d0ad300c299\"\u003eDownload xlsx file template\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"68d35b0d3874\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8e2a7daeb6af\"\u003e\u003cac:inline-comment-marker ac:ref=\"b7fdcc22-ba10-43c9-9284-4d90664136f3\"\u003eTo be able to download excel file template without values\u003c/ac:inline-comment-marker\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"72ed5c9b7769\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f7043d35d966\"\u003eImport button\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"276b3fc998e1\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"19cccf27f002\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b8cd4f471f57\"\u003eClicking on Import button will check file structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"209585bcca21\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ca5cc2579568\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f1c79d5f46a8\"\u003eDisplay loader while importing file\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"993dd0c261e1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"da2be908dc6f\"\u003eIf file structure is correct system will automatically create and start process for data import in system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b2140cf15e6e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0ea947c26764\"\u003eIf file structure is not correct, system should display a warning message\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"1526a31d5f34\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ac025ad49352\"\u003eCancel button\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"e13d48e4b73f\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"e067577a66ec\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"04417814236d\"\u003eCheck changes and if there are changes made then warning pop-up message comes out with buttons: \u0027Your changes are not saved, are you sure you want to cancel mass import?\u0027 Yes/No\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"8f5a8e3261ee\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b7999bf2134d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"314fe531ae92\"\u003eYes - will close pop-up and return to listing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0ea0998bc40d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ffb40b0645f3\"\u003eNo - will close page and user stays on mass import page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"341c4c14bc22\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bc7f9ac3e8a7\"\u003eWarning message should be managed from the system settings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0c3d80f5892e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0bf5b2b39e60\"\u003eIf no changes, then directly return to previous page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"44442aad20b9\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"065e8219adfc\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMass Import of customers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"1564bfde5fbb\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"df6a8f07b14e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bbc2f1c3b670\"\u003eExcel file template will have predefined structure:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"c879cff5446c\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"cf141310eba6\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"edfbf9b35572\"\u003eThere are two columns\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"d88bc30c62f7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"beb4a6a18545\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"319e98f70eaf\"\u003eCustomer ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9e3b43e5603d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fcecb749f63c\"\u003eVersion of the customer\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"6ee9ba1e4c3b\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"af285aebc6dd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"910067020ae4\"\u003eOptional\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"383e0f68fa9d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fff8efec2fcc\"\u003eTake latest version if not filled\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"3e8331603e0d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a5fe9a64c3f3\"\u003eEach row represents a single customer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4dc161b844f3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"986b16527ced\"\u003eAfter importing add each Customer to the receivers list of Mass E-Mail communication\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b3acd3154cb7\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c7102c05f157\"\u003e Customer ID-s should be added to the receivers list, separated by \u0026ldquo;, \u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"be4b4b3cc668\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5aeda7865e28\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMass Import of contracts\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"9ba0f60b3af3\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"96c36d996406\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"723d8bff6b0c\"\u003eExcel file template will have predefined structure:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"4f38f1f822c3\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9ef0e1c799b4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1518bf526071\"\u003eThere are two columns\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"183a3650600b\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"534130de31ee\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"941e87324ff1\"\u003eContract ID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"65f1b39fc90d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e54e377d7ff0\"\u003eVersion of the Contract\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"97b4bfb7ce75\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"19f5c5b5d484\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0a5c0db96e75\"\u003eOptional\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"1491b5cce7f0\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"47f6df899bc6\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eIf not filled, system selects the latest contract version in status Valid/Signed by both sides. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"da7eb70d4bfe\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"74cde890539e\"\u003eEach row represents a single contract.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6b20fc696faf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6b70ec6daa50\"\u003eAfter importing add each Customer related to the imported contracts to the receivers list of Mass E-Mail communication\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b4d521d7f57b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"82a97afbc422\"\u003e Customer ID-s of related customers should be added to the receivers list, separated by \u0026ldquo;, \u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5696b4f16a23\"\u003eCustomer Feedbacks:  \u003ca href=\"https://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2815\" local-id=\"6bb7949b4eb4\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2815\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e",
